The log-posterior you specified in Stan is different from what you have in BUGS.  It should be

lp__ <- lp__ + lgamma(...)  (not `-` in what you really have).

In addition, your prior should be outside the loop of 1:N though thy do not contribute much to the log-posterior.

--
Jiqiang

