> it will be positive definite with probability 1.0 (because it is really
> parameterized in terms of its Cholesky factor). For example,
>
> parameters {
>   cov_matrix[3] Sigma;
> }
>
> It gets tricky if you want a covariance matrix that has additional
> structure, but it is doable (and hopefully will be easy in Stan 2.0.x).
>
> Ben
>

