In the general case, it may be beneficial to report (or have available) the initial parameter set instead of just the seed.  While the process may not be 100% deterministic (due to architecture, compiler, or optimization differences not to mention different versions of Stan), ideally a good initial parameter set would be stable for any version on Stan.

-Eric

