That's what should happen with the model coded like that in Stan.

You don't even need to define a variable N[i], you can just
write:

  log(a/b) ~ normal(mu,sd);

The only issue is that it's up to you to do the Jacobian adjustment
for the change of variables.  I keep meaning to write a longer section
on how to do this in the manual.

> A
