Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Fitting an ODE model with stan
Message-ID: <SXjo1WJDWKw.Gb-6FyZqeN0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <SXjo1WJDWKw.knkRAJQ18IoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <SXjo1WJDWKw.txnKdNaG4aEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <SXjo1WJDWKw.knkRAJQ18IoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
