Subject: Setting one element of parameter vector to zero
Message-ID: <7eiyZTjVMM4.k9EXHAMlIYMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/7eiyZTjVMM4/m/k9EXHAMlIYMJ>
